WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
Welcome to the Digital Confidence Centre, built to help adults feel confident with technology.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:11.880
Short lessons on scams, banking, passwords, video calls and more.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:17.952
This is the beta site. You are one of the first to see it, and we thank you for your time.

00:00:17.952 --> 00:00:23.304
As you go, tell us what you think. Do as much or as little as you like.

00:00:23.304 --> 00:00:29.136
A feedback tool is on the screen at any point. Use it any time.

00:00:29.136 --> 00:00:34.344
Every comment shapes the version that goes to the public. Come back any time.

00:00:34.344 --> 00:00:39.072
From Two Birds Innovation, thank you for your feedback and your time.
